222
00:26:23.450 --> 00:26:31.310
Sukun Tarachandani: Same way for data columns. In principle, you can run EC broadcast on top of this thing, and, like, yeah, so also get the benefits.

223
00:26:31.450 --> 00:26:46.499
Sukun Tarachandani: And, like, yeah, the whole point is that if you think of a baseline broadcast protocol, there are only… there is only so much design space there. Like, if you say message semantics in the application, what you want is a way to make topic

